comment.narrative:
Aggregate baseline: S/. 916. Aggregated end of project value achieved: S/. 1603

The indicator is reported for the totality of the Territorial Development Plans financed by Aliados II (563 plans). The indicator was calculated considering the information collected from each subproject in an initial situation (baseline) and a final situation (situation with project) with respect to prductive assets directly linked to the territorial development plan financed by ALIADOS. That is, the valuation of the assets was limited to the family assets needed to develop the project financing activity. It should be noted that in the ALIADOS II baseline study, the productive assets of the whole family unit were valued for the purposes of the&nbsp;project&#39;s evaluation.

&nbsp;
